      129.62,
      420.36,
      458.38,
      433.69
    ],
    "text": "Imposition of Tobacco Tax on Beedi under the Tobacco Tax Act, No. 8 of 1999",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      445.55,
      542.5,
      471.69
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Tobacco Tax Act, No. 8 of 1999, as amended, I, Anura Kumara Dissanayake, Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development do by this Order:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      482.39,
      542.57,
      507.69
    ],
    "text": "1. Repeal Regulation 2 of the \u201cRegulations for Levying the Tobacco Tax for Beedi\u201d published in the Extraordinary Gazette No.2312/71 dated December 31, 2022; and",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      518.55,
      438.44,
      531.69
    ],
    "text": "2. Determine the Tobacco Tax at Three Rupees (Rs. 3/-) for every beedi produced in Sri Lanka.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      542.55,
      267.77,
      555.69
    ],
    "text": "This Order shall come in to effect from April 02, 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      567.55,
      524.2,
      606.69
    ],
    "text": "Anura Kumara Dissanayake, Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development.",
    "fonts": [
